/** Installs the application menus. macOS displays them in the system menu bar; Windows and Linux render the Kit menu bar here. Declare one in the main window. Changed labels, checked/disabled flags and children reload automatically. Hiding or removing the owning menu bar removes its installed menus. MenuItem entries require text and a Shortcut command; the active window handles that command. Missing commands disable an item. Custom rows, href and onSelect throw; use a Shortcut handler for application actions. Ownership: retains menu labels and action names; Shortcut callbacks stay with their window. */
